# Repository-level attributes.
#
# The experiment folders keep their own byte-exactness rules in
# Experiments/<name>/.gitattributes (algorithm1, algorithm2, algorithm4).
# Large data files stay in Git LFS; the patterns below only cover paths that
# moved out of the original flat repository layout.
#
# NOTE: GitHub rejects any single file above 100 MB, so these must never be
# added as plain blobs.
# === algorithm3 benchmark: large data files via Git LFS ===
Experiments/algorithm3_benchmark/data/canonical/anime_runtime.jsonl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
Experiments/algorithm3_benchmark/data/cf/train_statistics.jsonl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
